stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> BoundReceipt: 기존 B source ACK와 AnyKey·membership receipt
    BoundReceipt --> StrictInterrupt: canonical parser가 terminal로 판정
    StrictInterrupt --> Candidate: 새 barrier 없음, Cancelled edge만 생성
    StrictInterrupt --> StoredBarrier: 기존 barrier가 남은 복원
    StoredBarrier --> Candidate: 동일 row·range·hash의 typed supersession
    StoredBarrier --> Held: 다른 genuine barrier는 보존
    BoundReceipt --> CompletePrefix: O complete-line cursor C
    CompletePrefix --> RawCandidate: exact execution Ended와 bounded tail
    RawCandidate --> Held: partial·nonterminal·foreign·unread
    Held --> CompletePrefix: 기존 O retry와 재관측
    RawCandidate --> Candidate: same source·nonce·EOF와 strict whole JSON
    Candidate --> CompletePrefix: current stamp 변경
    Candidate --> DurableResult: exact native 결과 CAS와 flush ACK
    BoundReceipt --> DurableResult: 기존 exact control 또는 E-notice policy
    DurableResult --> Cleanup: 기존 actor·episode·row CAS
    Cleanup --> [*]: cleanup ACK와 QueueEligible
    Candidate --> Boot: 결과 전 crash
    Boot --> CompletePrefix: 기존 custody adoption 후 새 EOF 검증
    DurableResult --> BootSaved: 결과 후 crash
    BootSaved --> Cleanup: durable proof 복원, 새 파일 증거 불필요
